| `scripts/bounded_match.py` | Matches configured or dataset regular expressions in one isolated child per batch; timeout and broken replies refuse naming the key without exposing inputs. | imported by `evals/` and the trailer and document gates | [`tests.child_timeout_seconds`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Search or fullmatch only; empty batches start no child. Stdlib-only and 3.6-safe; never ends the process. Not for credential policy matching: `scripts/child_env.py` owns that policy. | [python-style.md](../guides/python-style.md) | always |
